Package: yarr-media
Version: @VERSION@
Section: video
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Depends: curl, docker.io | docker-ce, docker-compose-v2 | docker-compose-plugin
Recommends: miniupnpc
Maintainer: Yarr Media <support@yarr.media>
Homepage: https://yarr.media
Description: Self-hosted movie, TV and music server
 Yarr Media organizes your own media and streams it to your TV, phone and
 browser. The server runs in Docker and updates itself nightly. After
 installing, run "sudo yarr-media-setup" to choose your media folder.
